<h2>Public Statement on Journalism Ethics and Story Submissions</h2>

<p>At RivCoDelivery, we believe in the power of community-driven journalism to shed light on local experiences and stories that matter to the people of Riverside County, California. Our newsroom is dedicated to providing a platform for voices that may otherwise go unheard by mainstream news outlets. However, we hold ourselves to high ethical standards and seek to ensure that every published story aligns with principles of responsible journalism.</p>

<h3>Our Commitment to Ethical Journalism:</h3>
<ul>
	<li>Truth and Accuracy – We strive for fairness and accuracy in all reports. Submitted stories must be fact-based, well-sourced, and verifiable.</li>
	<li>Accountability and Transparency – We are committed to transparency in our reporting. If errors occur, we will correct them promptly and openly.</li>
	<li>Impartiality and Fairness – We welcome diverse perspectives but require that submissions avoid misleading narratives, conflicts of interest, or undue bias.</li>
	<li>Respect and Sensitivity – All submitted stories should respect the dignity and privacy of individuals, especially in cases involving minors, sensitive personal matters, or vulnerable populations.</li>
	<li>Public Interest and Newsworthiness – We prioritize stories that have a direct impact on Riverside County, address community concerns, or highlight significant local developments.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Story Submission Guidelines:</h3>
<ul>
<li>All submissions must be original, written by the contributor, and free of plagiarism.</li>
<li>Topics should be relevant to Riverside County and its residents.</li>

<li>Contributors must disclose any affiliations or potential conflicts of interest related to their submission.</li>

<li>Stories that promote hate speech, misinformation, or personal attacks will not be accepted.</li>

<li>Submissions should include supporting evidence such as interviews, data, or firsthand accounts when possible.</li>
</ul>
<p>By adhering to these principles, RivCoDelivery aims to maintain the integrity of local journalism while amplifying voices that deserve to be heard. We encourage community members to share their stories with us, and together, we can ensure that impactful and ethically sound news reaches the people who need it most.</p>
